    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i have some hydrogen peroxide and some superglue in the garage, would it be better to use those to really kill any germs and seal the hole up so nothing gets in while i work? i just want to make sure it's totally airtight so i dont have to worry about it till i'm done with this project.",
