      "content": "okay i get not using the glue. but i'm really worried about it getting dirty out here and getting a bad infection or tetanus or something since the shovel was old and rusty. if i keep it covered with a bandage and some ointment, i dont really need to go get a tetanus shot right, do i? i'm pretty young and healthy so i feel like my immune system can handle it if i just keep it clean.",
